                     /inference="COORDINATES: similar to AA
                     sequence:RefSeq:WP_019940373.1"
                     /note="EboC, a homolog the polyprenyltransferase UbiA,
                     belongs to system of proteins involved in the trafficking
                     of precursor metabolites to an extracytoplasmic
                     compartment so that the biosynthesis of certain natural
                     products, such as scytonemin, can be completed.; EboC, a
                     homolog the polyprenyltransferase UbiA, belongs to system
                     of proteins involved in the trafficking of precursor
                     metabolites to an extracytoplasmic compartment so that the
                     biosynthesis of certain natural products, such as
                     scytonemin, can be completed; Derived by automated
                     computational analysis using gene prediction method:
                     Protein Homology."
